  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-at-skill",
      "text": "English | [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nA standalone DeepSeek Harness plugin that adds Skill invocation through `@name` without modifying Harness source code."
    },
    {
      "section": "Behavior",
      "text": "- Typing `@` in the conversation composer lists every user-invocable Skill available to the current session.\n- Typing more characters filters candidates by Skill-name prefix; settled catalog results are refreshed on the next request.\n- Picking a candidate inserts `@skill-name `.\n- Sending a whitespace-bounded `@skill-name` token loads that Skill deterministically before the model step.\n- Existing `/skill-name`, `@subagent`, and `@plugin` behavior remains owned by their original plugins."
    },
    {
      "section": "Behavior",
      "text": "The Skill group uses menu order `2`, after existing `@` reference groups, so it does not change their default Enter target."
    },
    {
      "section": "Compatibility",
      "text": "Requires Node.js 20 or newer and DeepSeek Harness >=0.2.2-rc.1 <0.3.0-0. This version is not compatible with the earlier 0.1.x Harness client."
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "Clone the repository, install dependencies, and add the local package to the Web profile:\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/452926826/dsh-at-skill.git\ncd dsh-at-skill\nnpm install\ndsh plugin --profile web add \"$PWD\"\n\nIt can also be installed directly from GitHub:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:452926826/dsh-at-skill\n```\n\nRestart `dsh web` after installation. The repository includes built `lib` artifacts so installing the package does not require a local Harness source checkout."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "Run `npm ci`, then `npm run build` and `npm run check`. The build uses npm dependencies and does not require a local Harness checkout."
    },
    {
      "section": "Limitation",
      "text": "Invocation is text-based and also matches tokens inside quotations and code blocks; it does not distinguish explicit picks from other text. If a Skill, subagent, or plugin shares the same `@name`, the submitted text carries no source identity; a matching user-invocable Skill is loaded by the Host plugin."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-at-skill",
      "text": "[English](README.md) | 简体中文\n\n一个独立的 DeepSeek Harness 插件，无需修改 Harness 源码即可通过 `@名称` 调用 Skill。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 在对话输入框中输入 `@` 时，列出当前会话可由用户调用的全部 Skill。\n- 继续输入字符时，按 Skill 名称前缀筛选候选项；已完成的目录查询不会长期缓存，下次请求会重新获取。\n- 选择候选项后插入 `@skill-name `。\n- 发送由空白字符分隔的 `@skill-name` 标记时，在模型执行前确定性加载对应 Skill。\n- 现有的 `/skill-name`、`@subagent` 和 `@plugin` 行为仍由各自原有插件负责。\n\nSkill 分组的菜单顺序为 `2`，位于已有的 `@` 引用分组之后，因此不会改变它们默认的 Enter 选择目标。"
    },
    {
      "section": "兼容性",
      "text": "需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本，以及 DeepSeek Harness >=0.2.2-rc.1 <0.3.0-0。本版本不兼容较早的 0.1.x Harness 客户端。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "克隆仓库、安装依赖，然后把本地包添加到 Web profile：\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/452926826/dsh-at-skill.git\ncd dsh-at-skill\nnpm install\ndsh plugin --profile web add \"$PWD\"\n\n也可以直接从 GitHub 安装：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:452926826/dsh-at-skill\n```\n\n安装后重启 `dsh web`。仓库已提交构建后的 `lib` 产物，普通安装不需要本地 DeepSeek Harness 源码 checkout。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "先运行 `npm ci`，再运行 `npm run build` 和 `npm run check`。构建使用 npm 依赖，不需要本地 Harness 源码 checkout。"
    },
    {
      "section": "限制",
      "text": "调用依赖文本匹配，也会匹配引用和代码块中的标记，无法区分显式选择与其他文本。如果 Skill、subagent 或插件使用相同的 `@名称`，提交文本本身不携带来源标识；Host 插件会加载名称匹配且允许用户调用的 Skill。"
    }
  ],
